<title>TURKEY: SOCCER SHOWCASE-FENERBAHCE BEAT GALATASARAY IN TURKISH LEAGUE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER SHOWCASE-FENERBAHCE BEAT GALATASARAY IN TURKISH LEAGUE.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-02-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fenerbahce beat Galatasaray 3-2</p>
<p>(halftime 1-1) a Turkish league soccer match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Fenerbahce - Augustine &quot;Jay Jay&quot; Okocha 16, Elvir Bolic 52</p>
<p>pen, 78.</p>
<p>Galatasaray - Vedat Inceefe 19, Arif Erdem 90.</p>
<p>Attendance: 30,000</p>
</text>
